              "text": "شکست دادن (shekast dâdan) — \"to defeat, to beat\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "سپاه (sepâh) کوچک دشمن را شکست داد. Sepâh-e kuchak doshman râ shekast dâd. The small army defeated the enemy."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "shekast \"a break, a defeat\" + dâdan \"to give\". Present shekast midahad."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "shekast \"a break, a defeat\" is the past stem of the native verb shekastan \"to break\", and dâdan \"to give\" is inherited Persian: to give someone a defeat."
            }
          ]
        },
