              "text": "فتح کردن (fath kardan) — \"to conquer, to capture\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "سپاه (sepâh) شهر را بعد از یک ماه فتح کرد. Sepâh shahr râ ba'd az yek mâh fath kard. The army captured the city after a month."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also of a summit: qolle râ fath kard \"he conquered the peak\". Present fath mikonad."
            }
          ]
        },
